{"id":"qarqarcay","qid":"Q2607299","category":"river","type":"hydronym","names":{"az":"Qarqarçay","ru":"Каркарчай","en":"Qarqar River"},"coordinates":[47.535,40.1589],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"qarabag","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q201647","az":"Ağdam rayonu","en":"Aghdam"},{"qid":"Q330790","az":"Xocalı rayonu","en":"Khojaly District"},{"qid":"Q330818","az":"Ağcabədi rayonu","en":"Aghjabadi District"},{"qid":"Q388960","az":"Şuşa rayonu","en":"Shusha District"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Qarqarçay - Kürün sağ qoludur. Şuşa, Xankəndi, Xocalı, Ağdam və Ağcabədi rayonları ərazizsindən axır.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Каркарчай, также Гаргарчай (азерб. Qarqarçay) или Каркар (арм. Կարկառ); в низовье — Гаджибабакобусу, — река в Азербайджане, правый приток Куры. Начинается в горах Карабахского хребта, который является частью Малого Кавказа, а согласно БРЭ и карте данной Британникой является частью и Армянского нагорья.\nВ античности Каркарчай являлся одной из трёх главных рек исторической области Арцах. Над рекой находится Шушинская крепость XVIII века.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"The Qarqarçay (Gargarchay), Qarqar, or Karkar (Armenian: Կարկառ) is a river located in Azerbaijan, in the drainage basin of the Kura. Parts of the river flow through Nagorno Karabakh. Its length is 115 kilometres (71 mi), and the area of the basin 1,490 square kilometres (580 sq mi). The river begins on the Karabakh Plateau at an altitude of 2,080 metres (6,820 ft) and is formed by the confluence of the rivers Zarysly and Khalfali. The main tributaries are the Ballyja, Badara and Daghdaghan.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/View_of_Qarqar_River_from_the_%C6%8Fsk%C9%99ran_fortress.jpg/960px-View_of_Qarqar_River_from_the_%C6%8Fsk%C9%99ran_fortress.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/View_of_Qarqar_River_from_the_%C6%8Fsk%C9%99ran_fortress.jpg/960px-View_of_Qarqar_River_from_the_%C6%8Fsk%C9%99ran_fortress.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":600,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:View_of_Qarqar_River_from_the_%C6%8Fsk%C9%99ran_fortress.jpg","title":"View of Qarqar River from the Əskəran fortress.jpg","artist":"Golden","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q2607299: Qarqar River","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2607299","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Qarqarçay","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Qarqar%C3%A7ay&oldid=8830571","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qarqar%C3%A7ay","revid":8830571,"revDate":"2026-04-24","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Каркарчай","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%9A%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%B9&oldid=143763325","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9A%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%B9","revid":143763325,"revDate":"2025-03-02","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Qarqarçay","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Qarqar%C3%A7ay&oldid=1374549038","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qarqar%C3%A7ay","revid":1374549038,"revDate":"2026-09-12","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:View of Qarqar River from the Əskəran fortress.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:View_of_Qarqar_River_from_the_%C6%8Fsk%C9%99ran_fortress.jpg","licence":"CC BY 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"review"}